---
---

<section class="w-full bg-mono-50 dark:bg-mono-900 py-12 px-6 lg:px-12 border-b border-mono-200 dark:border-mono-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-mono text-mono-500 font-semibold">
          // Validação em Produção
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold font-headline text-mono-900 dark:text-white uppercase mt-1">
          Métricas de Rigor & Qualidade
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-mono-500 font-mono">Diretriz: Problema real → Solução sólida → Evidência comprovada</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Structured Metric Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-mono-950 p-6 border border-mono-200 dark:border-mono-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-mono-500 uppercase tracking-wider">// Testes de Cobertura</span>
          <div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold font-headline text-mono-900 dark:text-white mt-2">54+</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-mono-600 dark:text-mono-400 mt-2 font-mono">
            Testes automatizados cobrindo rotas críticas, WebSockets e regras de negócio com Pytest e Vitest.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-mono-100 dark:border-mono-850 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-mono-500">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-signal-live"></span>
          <span>100% PASS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-mono-950 p-6 border border-mono-200 dark:border-mono-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-mono-500 uppercase tracking-wider">// Tempo de Resposta</span>
          <div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold font-headline text-mono-900 dark:text-white mt-2">&lt; 25ms</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-mono-600 dark:text-mono-400 mt-2 font-mono">
            Latência p99 em endpoints FastAPI com cache estruturado em memória e queries otimizadas em PostgreSQL.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-mono-100 dark:border-mono-850 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-mono-500">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-mono-400"></span>
          <span>HIGH THROUGHPUT</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-mono-950 p-6 border border-mono-200 dark:border-mono-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-mono-500 uppercase tracking-wider">// Concorrência Realtime</span>
          <div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold font-headline text-mono-900 dark:text-white mt-2">100%</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-mono-600 dark:text-mono-400 mt-2 font-mono">
            Sincronização determinística de estado de salas entre múltiplos clientes conectados via WebSockets.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-mono-100 dark:border-mono-850 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-mono-500">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-signal-live"></span>
          <span>WEBSOCKET SYNC</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-mono-950 p-6 border border-mono-200 dark:border-mono-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-mono-500 uppercase tracking-wider">// Decisões Arquiteturais</span>
          <div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold font-headline text-mono-900 dark:text-white mt-2">ADRs</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-mono-600 dark:text-mono-400 mt-2 font-mono">
            Todas as decisões técnicas críticas são registradas formalmente em Architecture Decision Records.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-mono-100 dark:border-mono-850 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-mono-500">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-mono-400"></span>
          <span>DOCUMENTED</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
